# Doc gate config — development and CI only. It promotes
# `unresolved-doc-reference` to an ERROR so `make doc` fails the build here.
# pub.dev runs dartdoc itself and would honour the same setting, so shipping it
# would let a future dartdoc release break documentation generation for an
# ALREADY-PUBLISHED version, which can never be re-cut. CI runs the gate before
# publish.yml publishes, so the archive is clean without carrying the strictness.
dartdoc_options.yaml

